WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.168
Watch and read: Ama asks: Join “un” and “happy”. What word do you make?

00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:09.769
The answer is: unhappy. Meaningful word parts help us decode longer words.

00:00:10.617 --> 00:00:13.219
Watch and read: Which word rhymes with “cat”?

00:00:14.617 --> 00:00:18.286
The answer is: hat. cat and hat have similar ending sounds.
